                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="header-content-slot">
                <div class="badge3">PMv3</div>
                <div>
                    <h1>Point Machine Operation &mdash; V3</h1>
                    <div class="sub">Current-only model &middot; fault-FAMILY-code output (PM_IRS_TWS_FAULT_WISDOM.md &sect;8.2) &middot; relabeled from raw waveform, not the old behaviour-vocabulary</div>
                </div>
                <div class="header-spacer"></div>
